stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT: Create new version
    DRAFT --> EFFECTIVE: Passes FEK compliance check<br/>and is signed into force
    DRAFT --> [*]: Draft abandoned
    EFFECTIVE --> SUPERSEDED: New version takes effect
    SUPERSEDED --> ARCHIVED: Retention period expires
    ARCHIVED --> [*]

    note right of EFFECTIVE
        Exactly one version is EFFECTIVE
        at any time
        Change events broadcast via CFEP
    end note
    note right of SUPERSEDED
        Remains queryable
        Historical entries and trades
        cite this version
    end note
